<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:57Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Berlin's punitive measures unlikely to deter Putin: experts</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5ee1e149cdd9e48dff093d9e83a6195035d5f3a6cfdc6edfc1c6709b17f6d490</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:27Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T17:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/berlin-s-punitive-measures-unlikely-to-deter-putin-experts/a-78803217--1019fd9fdcc2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/berlin-s-punitive-measures-unlikely-to-deter-putin-experts/a-78803217?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany has announced punitive measures after publicly blaming Russia for an attempted airport drone attack. But a former diplomat, political and security analysts warn it will likely do little to deter the Kremlin.</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>Unity at last: Is Libya's damaging power struggle at an end?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:78a2997c98d8dc38ce40518374550976384ef54c6be5132823be21b6fa67232c</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:30Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T17:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/unity-at-last-is-libya-s-damaging-power-struggle-at-an-end/a-78758325--c023aa2cebed.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/unity-at-last-is-libya-s-damaging-power-struggle-at-an-end/a-78758325?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For over a decade, Libya has been split between two opposing governments. Elections, meant to end the rivalry and unite the country, are now scheduled within two years.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: How to woo voters with an immigrant background</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:590e3f77856846c20cd9e6ae793ffd42d5344df3e2633efdd76ee53ef422cc0a</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:33Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T16:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-how-to-woo-voters-with-an-immigrant-background/a-78790775--d51a382b1b9e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-how-to-woo-voters-with-an-immigrant-background/a-78790775?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The number of voters in Germany with an immigrant background is rising. Yet the established parties barely manage to reach them. Why not?</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Macron visits Bayeux Tapestry with King Charles, PM Andy Burnham</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dded7d9b07a6d71527a9621de0beb204f05f569f3989361343ac15a98169081c</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T16:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/macron-visits-bayeux-tapestry-with-king-charles-pm-andy-burnham/a-78772317--2b18eacc4fb4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/macron-visits-bayeux-tapestry-with-king-charles-pm-andy-burnham/a-78772317?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">French President Emmanuel Macron is on a shorter-term visit to the UK than the renowned on-loan 11th century tapestry. He viewed the ancient artwork with the UK monarch and relatively new Prime Minister Andy Burnham.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russia's hybrid attacks on Germany: When is it 'war?'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:83f3e46b42c467362b18a8c35eaa94b4448686e6b161922532a7aa70e0258409</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:38Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T15:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-s-hybrid-attacks-on-germany-when-is-it-war/a-78784262--fedfa401971d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-s-hybrid-attacks-on-germany-when-is-it-war/a-78784262?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The German government is holding Russia responsible for an unsuccessful attack in Leipzig. Yet many feel that its response has been too mild.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Austria women ice hockey team fight for future generations</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:441733cd8573b29615b98e91cf737a1d62f752c3ba3e6005102833e901ceabfc</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T15:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/austria-women-ice-hockey-team-fight-for-future-generations/a-78771578--54a1e0f96b9c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/austria-women-ice-hockey-team-fight-for-future-generations/a-78771578?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Austria are getting ready for their first Women's Ice Hockey World Championship. But preparations have been overshadowed by a dispute about conditions, pay and getting men's cast off kit. A solution now looks in sight.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>US sanctions halt TOEFL and GRE tests in Iran, disrupting study plans</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2a52e98238978f0424c8486b9474860a9e141aed531d9f15ff3603ec502ac2e4</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T14:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-sanctions-halt-toefl-and-gre-tests-in-iran-disrupting-study-plans/a-78764639--eb09c13fa9f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-sanctions-halt-toefl-and-gre-tests-in-iran-disrupting-study-plans/a-78764639?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Students in Iran can no longer take TOEFL and GRE exams after a US sanctions exemption was suspended. Applicants say the move threatens university deadlines and adds costly travel obligations.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine: Zelenskyy warns airlines to avoid Russian airspace</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:442b780eb97ab090eac341446ce87476cac010fe1edd02827e6b3810fc4d6737</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:47Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T14:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-zelenskyy-warns-airlines-to-avoid-russian-airspace/live-78755199--dfb0c9748a24.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-zelenskyy-warns-airlines-to-avoid-russian-airspace/live-78755199?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Volodymyr Zelenskyy warned a surge in Ukrainian drones in Russia's skies meant Russian airspace would be "effectively" closed. Meanwhile, Russian drones have hit Kyiv for a seventh straight day. Follow DW for more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Guinea-Bissau referendum tests democratic future</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c73fa0d6f8108153904bf88a55d52654717c862012509f71b086cc9886c5f77a</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:50Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T13:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/guinea-bissau-referendum-tests-democratic-future/a-78646043--39099143203c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/guinea-bissau-referendum-tests-democratic-future/a-78646043?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Following voter approval of a constitutional change that expands presidential powers, Guinea-Bissau faces renewed debate over legitimacy, civilian rule and democratic safeguards.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India rejects Hague ruling on Indus waters: What's next?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:34469ed11d5cb57a58d14e41ca7382f6e82a399efb91364dad5f68badcb3811f</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:27:54Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T13:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-rejects-hague-ruling-on-indus-waters-what-s-next/a-78753249--da3e0c27e091.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-rejects-hague-ruling-on-indus-waters-what-s-next/a-78753249?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">By rejecting an international arbitration panel's ruling, New Delhi has cast fresh doubt on the future of the 1960 Indus Waters Treaty.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Police exhume body of former Czechoslovak foreign minister Jan Masaryk</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b95aeca465587d0eb2fe4e9fa140b2eabd86e3f33fad774beae7901f4316cd8a</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T12:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/police-exhume-body-of-former-czechoslovak-foreign-minister-jan-masaryk/a-78745254--691899c25c64.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/police-exhume-body-of-former-czechoslovak-foreign-minister-jan-masaryk/a-78745254?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The top diplomat was found dead on March 10, 1948, in the courtyard beneath his bathroom window, supposedly after a fall. Police said their probe aims to settle questions that have surrounded the death ever since.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Armed men abduct Kenyan editor, employer suspects government</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5baa2b19450cbe553c3e79b65649c2e0180933cc745542d2d09e80bc36cfbb45</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T12:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/armed-men-abduct-kenyan-editor-employer-suspects-government/a-78721264--ff71d6e16ceb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/armed-men-abduct-kenyan-editor-employer-suspects-government/a-78721264?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A newspaper editor in Kenya was kidnapped from a car late on Tuesday and then located near a dam far away a few hours later. The Standard paper said it suspected state involvement in an attempt to intimidate reporters.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU summons Russian envoy over failed Leipzig drone attack</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ff217872463f76262434c9c1671f0e160016e2dbaf2b384cff387a477f3cf074</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T08:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-summons-russian-envoy-over-failed-leipzig-drone-attack/a-78687280--165732ae8dab.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-summons-russian-envoy-over-failed-leipzig-drone-attack/a-78687280?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU's foreign policy chief Kaja Kallas said the attempted attack had "all the hallmarks of state-sponsored terrorism." She said the EU was summoning a Russian envoy, with France announcing a similar step.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What really helps Europe deal with drought</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5c02e8af7e620b1be5399775a23f7ed201e96827cb04f090faae5d6dc43f7501</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T07:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-really-helps-europe-deal-with-drought/a-78577712--d183cadee76b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-really-helps-europe-deal-with-drought/a-78577712?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Fix leaks, or ban pools? As European countries prepare for hotter, drier years to come, here's what the data says about how to really save water.</summary><category term="Climate" /></entry><entry><title>Charlie Kirk murder suspect to face potential death penalty</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3b442a8a318e019a8f21eb695f9e4d6ca9c6a64f21a2fa783f60333ddad82ef8</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T07:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/charlie-kirk-murder-suspect-to-face-potential-death-penalty/a-78664853--729208e5b5a4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/charlie-kirk-murder-suspect-to-face-potential-death-penalty/a-78664853?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Tyler R., accused of fatally shooting Charlie Kirk, will stand trial on aggravated murder charges after a Utah judge ruled prosecutors had enough evidence to seek the death penalty.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Women's football: Anyomi, London City and the German exodus</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ea2f535d65c3bcefd721a3d17b759a32beb2c4fbff732990fff56bec23a1a3f9</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T07:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/women-s-football-anyomi-london-city-and-the-german-exodus/a-78446131--26908c4ff9f0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/women-s-football-anyomi-london-city-and-the-german-exodus/a-78446131?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nicole Anyomi has joined Alexia Putellas and other star names in signing for the ambitious English club London City Lionesses. The Germany winger told DW England is a better place to develop her game than back home.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Cargo ship with 10 crew sinks off Turkey coast — authorities</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d686d483416aa46db457e376292ba19987757fc2dc017138fc05a5d68b126f3d</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T06:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cargo-ship-with-10-crew-sinks-off-turkey-coast-authorities/a-78676617--bf06eae0d