vil society is being silenced.</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>Hong Kong activist Joshua Wong pleads guilty to collusion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a3671817d9a44a85a873ccffde86047e1d493e75041d5816b6d2302661479ba5</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T02:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hong-kong-activist-joshua-wong-pleads-guilty-to-collusion/a-78657525--e463876939eb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hong-kong-activist-joshua-wong-pleads-guilty-to-collusion/a-78657525?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The prominent activist pleaded guilty to colluding with foreign entities. He faces a lengthy prison sentence.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran war: US, Tehran trade fire in new flare-up</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0630bf1c656ae8cf53716c0d62f9940f43cd5e1057d91b3ca269ae1d9c786c68</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T01:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-war-us-tehran-trade-fire-in-new-flare-up/live-78656656--b10423fe5e8c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-us-tehran-trade-fire-in-new-flare-up/live-78656656?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Explosions have been reported around the Strait of Hormuz, including at an airport in southern Iran. US President Donald Trump said the strikes were a response to Iranian attempts to mine the strait. Follow DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
